<title>USA: Wells Fargo raises prime rate to 8.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Wells Fargo raises prime rate to 8.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wells Fargo &amp; Co Wednesday said it raised its prime lending rate to 8.50 percent from 8.25 percent, effective today.</p>
<p>The move follows a decision by the Federal Reserve on Tuesday to raise the federal funds rate by 25 basis points to 5.50 percent and to leave the discount rate unchanged.</p>
</text>
